      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26c1ce8cad41038737720db5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天皇赏（秋）结束后・到达",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec09b7cf4f5870a6af51a123286efcfe4e686a6dbd5c9fa74b76f111d426d0a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067438.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b550f9b5d59aa3761e216927",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见光钻跑完了日本C。\n东海帝王对她的表现\n以及极度渴望击败对手的眼神表示赞赏。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e204659b7d3cce356c23f027a5246615f3c6708fee64e3c0fa26d88cdeb6a03",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067439.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28bad13e140c733cb5c461f5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王说起自己也总是\n把自己定位在挑战者身份的心路历程。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d4b5da465ddba685de5945f0203345fb9162727719d7fea50b2f7273482dbb1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067439.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b307bee09eec165331521452",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听完东海帝王所说的话后，\n里见光钻也产生\n想要持续当一名挑战者的想法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c05b88e340ac160ee5aab620caa8e21b4aa06ee2ee7d090689ebf964679d97",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067439.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87bb49982de90070c58b9aa6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "决心要挑战各种事情，\n为里见家和日本赛马娘界\n开拓新的历史。",
      "source_fingerprint": "007190687c8625ac4babf615dafd61f6fd03cb07c831cc013c95e16cc43a6555",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067439.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4af9a09dcf37ea2ae0d89311",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这就是里见光钻所认为的\n“知名赛马娘”该有的姿态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "687aa3c732ddad50c460107d7a3f473f0f407a2d0ea5cd440cb239c38f004382",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067439.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddd9cb1944530e858a1049c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日本C结束后・挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a0cc49152aad24269813382fbc044e8f469650bb8501b1a20ae7f2fd74dc1d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067439.json",
