      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61778c84df4184bde92c08c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就算选择的道路不同，\n也会各自向前迈进。\n两人约好要一直并肩走下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7654bd584dfa65bde74fa6b3b616c0f3d2a6cf2c0eba63bd58d3faa279dce5ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067440.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:519d7f1a53c1d63222e7a57b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・至宝",
      "source_fingerprint": "462cee4ee05ba649e0331a639b7d0440b778a659fe0d07adc219f6c14c99a517",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067440.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4b910d8067201756b909659",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员在街上看见正在举办\n“里见光钻GⅠ获胜纪念活动”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c489fd61a65fae9a476d37f63b2c1b175a92569a749f7eaf83c2796691b498c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067441.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0d3cdcd668c719acfa48b99",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "根据碰巧遇到的里见光钻和北部玄驹所说，\n里见集团的相关设施\n正在举办获胜纪念活动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88001795e217bb28fbaefe7bbbf1584e556f8e79bd0e87baaa9364aee5626584",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067441.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e914a0a1e3b713c7f20d2eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见光钻因为也想要做出一点贡献，\n便四处拜访办活动的设施，\n并赠送纪念品。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c3087979baaf872604c6657db8de9eddc9ae5c082d4b74a85384c2843b5e0b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067441.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adb178291dadbc093dd759c3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员决定和两人一起同行。\n并在过程中得知，里见集团正在所有相关设施\n举办纪念活动的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40b0030097b2e4723afcd9c8c667ba22edc76e53ba18fd8e06763836eb9533c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067441.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9e11623a9ed858f43691c1e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这让训练员更加清楚地明白，\n里见家对里见光钻在GⅠ获胜的事情，\n是多么喜悦的事实。",
      "source_fingerprint": "971bc07e960b1c049b20acb03729ca6b54e7c135eabb4cae511f13dc0c689563",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067441.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f4d5f0bbe7d15d37b1c2a24",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "支持我的大家",
      "source_fingerprint": "20cb9a57fd4f0ece0e0eaa333997ae03826590ca2fa734ce230fc5a7b7aff4c2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067441.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd48fc990cf291ac00ae958d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "和里见光钻一起观战“宝冢纪念”。\n北部玄驹的表现平平，输了比赛。\n她失常的表现让观众也相当震惊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ead12728cffd6ac7fcc15fa26fc45487868e1d1362385d6d628d0e207d776cef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067442.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a554ceb187a87342878a57f7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北部玄驹因为“天皇赏（春）”激战的影响，\n一定累积了不少的疲劳。\n但她却没有适当休息，导致身体超过负荷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "054ba42b24dbf16662f3656e07fd2cb4e41b36cee12c1a141daa23a94d25cd19",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067442.json",
      "json_path": [
